{"applicability_conditions":"用于高熵钢中硅化物（Fe5Si3型）和B2型析出相的弥散强化计算；Ω 及 M、G、υ 的取值来自 Taylor 因子、混合法则计算的剪切模量及文献给定泊松比。","identity":{"block_id":"b0097","equation_id":"equation_007","equation_number":"7","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\Delta \\sigma_ {p} = \\frac {0 . 4 M G b}{\\pi \\lambda} \\frac {\\ln \\left(\\frac {2 \\bar {r}}{b}\\right)}{\\sqrt {1 - v}}\\tag{7}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2023.144776"},"latex":"\\Delta \\sigma_{p} = \\frac{0.4 M G b}{\\pi \\lambda} \\frac{\\ln \\left(\\frac{2 \\bar{r}}{b}\\right)}{\\sqrt{1 - v}}","purpose":"计算硅化物和B2型析出相对高熵钢强度的贡献，即弥散强化（析出强化）增量 Δσ_p。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"弥散强化（析出强化）对屈服强度的贡献量","symbol":"\\Delta \\sigma_{p}","unit":null,"value":"54 MPa (silicide, BCC phase), 111 MPa (B2-type, BCC phase), 55 MPa (silicide, B2-type)"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"公式中的数值系数（几何因子）","symbol":"0.4","unit":null,"value":"0.4"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Taylor 因子","symbol":"M","unit":null,"value":"2.73"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"剪切模量，用混合法则计算","symbol":"G","unit":"GPa","value":"75.34 GPa"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"伯格斯矢量（Burgers vector），b = (√3/2)a，a 为 BCC 的晶格常数","symbol":"b","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"BCC 相晶格常数","symbol":"a","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率常数","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"析出相之间的间距，λ = 2r̄(√(π/4f) − 1)","symbol":"\\lambda","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"球形析出相的平均半径（圆截面对应），r̄ = √(2/3) r","symbol":"\\bar{r}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"析出相的平均半径","symbol":"r","unit":"nm","value":"102 nm (Fe5Si3-type), 220 nm (B2-type)"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"析出相的体积分数","symbol":"f","unit":null,"value":"8.4% (Fe5Si3-type), 34% (B2-type)"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"泊松比（原文用 υ 表示）","symbol":"v","unit":null,"value":"0.3"}],"unmapped":["公式中 ln 为自然对数算子。","原文泊松比符号写作 υ，公式中记为 v。"]}